u","last_verified_at":"2026-11-22T00:00:00+00:00","active":true,"created_at":"2026-11-22T19:10:42.626683+00:00"},"i18n":[{"lang":"en","warnings":"Check the weather, trail conditions and local restrictions before setting off. This record does not confirm that the route is currently open. Keep forest roads and emergency access clear.","access_id":17,"directions":"The recorded walking segment starts at Prze\u0142\u0119cz P\u0142oszczyna and ends at Rudawiec. The map link shows the hiking route; it does not establish vehicle access or legal parking.\nThis variant starts at Prze\u0142\u0119cz P\u0142oszczyna, not Bielice. Parking in Nowa Morawa is not the GPX start.","public_transport":"A current service to this route start has not been confirmed. Check the timetable for your travel date and plan the return."},{"lang":"pl","warnings":"Sprawd\u017a prognoz\u0119, stan szlaku i lokalne zakazy przed wyj\u015bciem. Opis nie potwierdza bie\u017c\u0105cego otwarcia trasy. Nie blokuj dr\u00f3g le\u015bnych ani dojazdu s\u0142u\u017cb ratowniczych.","access_id":17,"directions":"Pocz\u0105tek opisanego odcinka: Prze\u0142\u0119cz P\u0142oszczyna. Koniec: Rudawiec. Link do mapy pokazuje tras\u0119 piesz\u0105; nie potwierdza dojazdu samochodem ani legalnego parkingu.\nTen wariant zaczyna si\u0119 na Prze\u0142\u0119czy P\u0142oszczyna, a nie w Bielicach. Parking w Nowej Morawie nie jest pocz\u0105tkiem GPX.","public_transport":"Nie potwierdzono aktualnego po\u0142\u0105czenia do pocz\u0105tku tej trasy. Sprawd\u017a rozk\u0142ad na dzie\u0144 wycieczki i zaplanuj powr\u00f3t."},{"lang":"ua","warnings":"\u041f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0432\u0438\u0445\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043c \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0432\u0456\u0440\u0442\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u0433\u043e\u0434\u0443, \u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d \u0441\u0442\u0435\u0436\u043a\u0438 \u0439 \u043c\u0456\u0441\u0446\u0435\u0432\u0456 \u043e\u0431\u043c\u0435\u0436\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f. \u0426\u0435\u0439 \u043e\u043f\u0438\u0441 \u043d